   "lines": [
    "For some unexplained",
    "reason Tom Ludlow",
    "has asked me to",
    "be usher at his",
    "wedding; so has",
    "Jack Roosevelt.",
    "Have been made",
    "the confidant",
    "of West, Em",
    "& Al in their",
    "love affairs.",
    "Old Nell had",
    "two of his friends",
    "up to dine with",
    "me; I liked one,",
    "Russell, very much."
   ],
